Material modifications include a single Cloudflare Worker with Static Assets,
Cloudflare Access JWT enforcement, D1/KV/R2 core persistence, immutable chat
revisions, AI Gateway capability routing, Cloudflare Vectorize retrieval,
Maintenance Workflows, bounded resource operations, and removal of the
application account and runtime extension systems.

